  triage:resolutionNote "quality-mgr BB-READY-BOOTSTRAP-QA1-1789283208 Final Quality Report (report 01M2CT30N5ERF59Z39JTEWNXBW, PR #1480). tools/bootstrap.toml:14 keeps cargo-shear pinned at 1.13.3; :26-33 adds a pinned, checksummed [cargo-binstall] 1.22.0 (4 checksums, aarch64 hash independently recomputed and matched exactly) so the prebuilt path is always taken; the unreachable cargo-install source-build fallback in tools/bootstrap.py is deleted (writer search clean); Rust pin unchanged; binstall receipt current_version 1.13.3 is the version authority per fenix's ruling; .just/tests/test_bootstrap.py 36/36. Independently confirmed by req-qa and arch-qa. Delivery history: arch-ctm's BB-READY-BOOTSTRAP-FIX-R2 closed with no edits; fenix re-routed to solar as BB-READY-BOOTSTRAP-FIX-R3-1789281469 on the same branch/PR, which delivered this fix. This closes the last open item from solar's Phase BB production-readiness review." .
